             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Sibling of treatment plan specification, not a child: a prophylaxis is planned to keep a condition from arising, not to treat one. Named with the plan-specification pattern by decision (2026-09-17); 'method used for prophylaxis' was the alternative."@en ;
             rdfs:label "prophylaxis plan specification"@en .


